  "statements": [
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "#Iamplenti"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Other",
      "notes": "Who is PlentiPlants for?\nWhether you're the strongest person on Earth, a health-conscious individual or you simply want to incorporate more plant-based nutrition in your life, PlentiPlants is designed for those who strive to become a better human. Use PlentiPlants after the gym, on your way to work, as a snack, or at any other time to boost your daily protein intake. Protein is beneficial for building lean muscle and strong bones and for maintaining healthy weight."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "About Us:\nWe were born out of both frustration and necessity. Originally purchasing supplements only to find them full of cheap fillers, low quality ingredients and cardboard taste was disappointing to say the least. We knew we had to step in and create an honest, high-quality company that gave customers what they wanted at a reasonable price. Focusing on science over sales, our products are thoughtfully crafted for an active lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Veteran Owned Business"
    },
    {
      "type": "Seals/Symbols",
      "notes": "Made in USA\nWith Global Ingredients"
    },
    {
      "type": "Seals/Symbols",
      "notes": "SQF Certified"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Does NOT Contain",
      "notes": "No banned substances"
    },
    {
      "type": "FDA Disclaimer Statement",
      "notes": "These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: All Other",
      "notes": "California Residents Only:\nWarning: Reproductive harm, www.P65Warnings.ca.gov/food"
    },
    {
      "type": "Seals/Symbols",
      "notes": "Crafted in our\nFDA Registered Facility"
    },
    {
      "type": "Seals/Symbols",
      "notes": "cGMP Certified Good Manufacturing Practice"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Does NOT Contain",
      "notes": "Gluten Free\nDairy Free\nSoy Free\nGMO Free"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Other",
      "notes": "Plant Based"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "21g Protein\n3g Net Carbs\nKeto_Friendly Coconut MCTs\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Organic",
      "notes": "Made with Organic Ingredients"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Does NOT Contain",
      "notes": "No dairy, soy or artificial ingredients"
    },
    {
      "type": "FDA Statement of Identity",
      "notes": "Protein Supplement"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Other",
      "notes": "5 Plant Based Protein Sources!!\nOur unique blend of pea, pumpkin, sunflower, hemp and almond proteins means a more complete protein means a more complete protein supplement with a smooth texture and a creamy taste."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Transparency\nUnlike other products, PlentiPlants features PlentiPlants features transparent labeling where we disclose the ratio of our different protein sources. We don't like secrets and we're betting you don't either."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Delicious Taste :)\nNo more deciding between a healthy shake or a great flavor, PlentiPlants combines the best of both worlds to give you a nutritious and delicious low carb, high protein snack!"
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Get in Touch!\nBodynutrition.com\nFacebook Bodynutritionco\nInstagram @Bodynutritionco"
    },
    {
      "type": "Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions",
      "notes": "Suggested Usage: Mix 1 scoop (38g) PlentiPlants in 12oz of cold water or another beverage (almond milk for example). Shake or blend for 20 seconds."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Allergies",
      "notes": "Allergen: Contains peanuts, coconut and almond. Manufactured in a facility that also processes eggs, milk, soy, wheat and tree nuts"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "Chocolate - Peanut Butter naturally flavored"
    }
